6. WHAT HAS BEEN ACHIEVED
A production-grade medallion data pipeline with automated refresh (Dynamic Tables), CDC (Streams), and auto-ingest (Snowpipe).
Data governance with privacy tags, DMF-based quality monitoring, cross-layer reconciliation checks, and health scorecards.
A comprehensive FinOps dashboard with 16 specialized tabs covering cost, performance, waste, anomalies, identity, and remediation — built entirely from Snowflake system metadata.
Infrastructure-as-code via Schemachange migrations (versioned + repeatable).
Operational monitoring for Dynamic Table refreshes, task health, and query performance.
AI-enhanced data (Cortex TRANSLATE for multilingual reviews).
