8. KEY ARCHITECTURAL INSIGHT
The entire cost analytics dashboard is built exclusively from Snowflake-provided system tables (ACCOUNT_USAGE, INFORMATION_SCHEMA, LOCAL). No external monitoring tools, no third-party agents — just SQL views on top of Snowflake's own metadata. This means:

Zero additional data ingestion cost
Always up-to-date (governed by Snowflake's own refresh SLAs)
No external dependencies to maintain
Can be replicated to any Snowflake account instantly
The e-commerce pipeline demonstrates how to combine this operational observability with actual business data processing in a single governed platform.
